{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026G4np2LKYJG1793318694.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國能源部公布有5家企業向美國政府借入1,675萬桶戰略石油儲備，而12個歐盟國家亦將從戰略石油儲備中釋放約4,260萬桶石油。</p><p></p><p>12個歐盟國家承諾將在明年一月底前聯合釋放約4,260萬桶戰略石油，當中約一半是柴油，以配合七大工業國在本月達成的協議，紓緩全球能源供應憂慮。</p><p></p><p>參與釋放戰略儲備的歐盟國家都是IEA國際能源儲署的成員，IEA在本月中曾呼籲成員國在冬季來臨前加快釋放石油儲備。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:00:58.501720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:21:24.464429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:17.609541+00:00","content_hash":"0c26a65ba5e9f6513dbc793782953137d64ef455a4ddfe8feb053adcfb6de212","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}